#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:3
msgid "Update channels"
msgstr "Canale de actualizare"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:5
msgid ""
"Whether you want the latest features, want to help with testing, or just "
"want to wait until everything is perfectly ready to go, we’ve got options "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"Fie că vrei cele mai noi funcții, vrei să ajuți la testare sau preferi să "
"aștepți până când totul e complet pregătit, avem opțiuni pentru tine."

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:7
msgid ""
"The desktop client has 4 update channels: *Enterprise*, *Stable*, *Beta* and"
" *Daily*."
msgstr ""
"Clientul pentru desktop are 4 canale de actualizare: *Enterprise*, *Stabil*,"
" *Beta* și *Zilnic*."

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:12
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "Canale"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:14
msgid "Enterprise"
msgstr "Enterprise"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:14
msgid ""
"Special version for enterprise customers for the best possible experience."
msgstr ""
"Versiune specială pentru clienții enterprise, pentru cea mai bună experiență"
" posibilă."

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:16
msgid "Stable"
msgstr "Stabil"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:16
msgid "Latest feature releases ready for most users at minimal risk."
msgstr ""
"Cele mai noi versiuni cu funcții noi, pregătite pentru majoritatea "
"utilizatorilor, cu risc minim."

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:18
msgid "Beta"
msgstr "Beta"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:18
msgid ""
"Short-term versions created in preparation for testers to report bugs "
"against before a stable release."
msgstr ""
"Versiuni de scurtă durată, create pentru ca testerii să poată raporta erori "
"înaintea unei versiuni stabile."

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:20
msgid "Daily"
msgstr "Zilnic"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:20
msgid ""
"Daily versions to reproduce bugs and to follow the development of the next "
"stable version."
msgstr ""
"Versiuni zilnice pentru reproducerea erorilor și urmărirea dezvoltării "
"următoarei versiuni stabile."

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:23
msgid "References:"
msgstr "Referințe:"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:25
msgid ""
"`Enterprise deployment options <https://nextcloud.com/blog/branded-"
"nextcloud-clients/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Opțiuni de implementare enterprise <https://nextcloud.com/blog/branded-"
"nextcloud-clients/>`_"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:26
msgid ""
"`Latest stable release <https://github.com/nextcloud-"
"releases/desktop/releases/latest/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Cea mai nouă versiune stabilă <https://github.com/nextcloud-"
"releases/desktop/releases/latest/>`_"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Pre-releases <https://github.com/nextcloud-releases/desktop/releases/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Versiuni preliminare <https://github.com/nextcloud-"
"releases/desktop/releases/>`_"

#: ../../desktop/updatechannel.rst:28
msgid "`Daily builds <https://download.nextcloud.com/desktop/daily/>`_"
msgstr "`Versiuni zilnice <https://download.nextcloud.com/desktop/daily/>`_"
